      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5a3ad8ac4a8da67427803715|full_name}: I request the UI become a bit more streamlined and linear. I also feel like the icons need to be brighter, yeah. Maybe a colorblind feature could be implemented as well? Text size should be changed ans it's quite small on my headset, maybe that's just me, but I've found it difficult to read some options in the new UI.",
